  next_bar: 201 [Q] CODA   key: G minor (the motto returns)   2/2, h=112
  dynamics: ff, subito
  At the seam: b200 one tutti ff G-MAJOR stroke on beat 1 (vn1 g3-d4-b4-
  g5, vn2 g4-d5, va g3, vc/fg g2, cb g1, fl g5-b5, ob d5-g5, cl b4-d5,
